# Citation File Format (https://citation-file-format.github.io/)
# GitHub renders this as a "Cite this repository" button and exports BibTeX/APA.
cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "De Novo Miniprotein Binder Design Against Myostatin (GDF-8)"
message: "If you use this repository, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Attila
    family-names: Beleon
    email: beleonattila@gmail.com
abstract: >-
  A reproducible pipeline for designing de novo helical miniprotein binders
  targeting the ActRIIB (type II receptor / knuckle) epitope of myostatin
  (GDF-8), using RFdiffusion for backbone generation, ProteinMPNN for sequence
  design, and ESMFold for in-silico self-consistency validation.
keywords:
  - protein design
  - de novo design
  - RFdiffusion
  - ProteinMPNN
  - ESMFold
  - myostatin
  - GDF-8
  - miniprotein binder
license: MIT
